      "text": "Measles: age-based vitamin A, ≥ 12 mo 200,000 IU; 6 to 11 mo 100,000 IU; < 6 mo 50,000 IU, orally once a day for 2 days, a third dose ≥ 2 wks later. Prolonged daily large doses, esp in infants, must be avoided (toxicity)."
